  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to (Here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>are distinct)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
